Files in this repository are modified from the upstream project. MarkVue
consists of:

  MarkVue.html                 Single-file renderer and editor
  markvue_app.py               Native desktop window via pywebview, backed by
                               a loopback HTTP server on 127.0.0.1
  markvue.py                   Local HTTP server mode
  Build EXE.bat                PyInstaller build script producing MarkVue.exe
  Launch MarkVue.bat           Python / pywebview launcher
  Associate .md Files.bat      Windows file-association setup
  Remove File Association.bat  Windows file-association removal
